'''Raspberries''' are fruits found growing on bushes in [[Meadows]]. The bushes can be harvested for 1 Raspberries, affected by [[Farming (Skill)]], and replenish after {{duration|18000}}. There is no way to replant berry bushes, and if they are destroyed they will not grow back.

Raspberries are valuable in both early game as a basic food item and in mid-to-late game as a necessary ingredient for the early-tier [[Queen's Jam]] and the [[Medium Healing Mead]]. Thus, gathering Raspberries when encountered is usually recommended.

